HamsterFlight is a fan reimplementation of the Flash game "Flight of the
Hamsters". It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original publisher.

The MIT licence in LICENSE applies to the original source code and
documentation in this repository. The following are NOT covered by it and
remain the property of their respective owners:

  src/assets/sprites/**            sprite sheets extracted from the original SWF
  src/assets/sprites.generated.ts  the placement manifest describing that art
  reference/as2/**                 decompiled ActionScript from the original SWF

They are included so the port can be verified against the original. Shipping
them is a deliberate choice by the repository owner, discussed in README.md
under "Assets"; replacing the art is a data change behind one manifest.

The original SWF itself is never committed.
